### 6. HTTPS/TLS Configuration

#### Vulnerability
Unencrypted HTTP exposes credentials to interception.

#### Remediation Code (Production)
```javascript
const https = require('https');
const fs = require('fs');

if (process.env.NODE_ENV === 'production') {
