### 8. CORS Configuration

#### Vulnerability
No CORS policy can enable cross-domain attacks.

#### Remediation Code
```javascript
const cors = require('cors');

const allowedOrigins = process.env.ALLOWED_ORIGINS?.split(',') || [
  'https://app.yourdomain.com'
];

const corsOptions = {
  origin: (origin, callback) => {
    if (!origin) {
      return callback(null, true); // Allow mobile apps/same-origin
